### 4) Run the jar file
```
java -jar target/calculator.jar
peter@Peter:~/ivolve/build-tools/lab1/CalculatorMavenApp/target$ java -jar calculator.jar
Enter first number: 6
Enter second number: 6
a = 6.0, b = 6.0
Sum: 12.0
Subtract: 0.0
Multiply: 36.0
Divide: 1.0```
